      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo oro kwenda, man gicoko judongo mi Yuda ceke man mi Yerusalem i bang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo idho malu ba ot pa Yehova, ku dhanu ceke mi Yuda man ju m’ubedo i Yerusalem ceke gikugi, ku julam, man jubila, ku dhanu ceke, ma thindho ku ma dongo de: man esomo lembe ceke mi kitabu mi lembariba ma junwang’u i ot pa Yehova i ithgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ubimo cungo ba mbegi, man etimo lembbariba i wang’ Yehova, kara elub tok Yehova, man ewor lembang’ola pare, ku lembatuca pare, man cik pare, kud adundene ceke man ku ng’eyong’ec pare ceke, kara etim lembe mi lembariba maeni m’ugore i kitabu maeni: man dhanu ceke gicungo kum lembaribane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
