                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kei 33:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo ng’olo ni Hilkia ma jalam ma dit, ku julam mi pok mir arionde, man jukur mi kamondo, kara giwodh agulu ceke woko kud i hekalu pa Yehova ma jutimo ni Bal, man ni mungu m’araga, man ni udul ceke m’i polo; e ewang’ugi ng’ei Yerusalem i pothi m’i Kidron, man etero vurune i Beth-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eredho julam mi mungu m’araga piny, m’ubimo mi Yuda ketho kara giwang’ udok ma ng’wice ng’ar i ka ma malu mir adhura mi Yuda, man i ka m’utieko Yerusalem gbur; ju ma giwang’u udok ma ng’wice ng’ar ni Bal bende, ni ceng’, man ni dwi, man ni cero ma dongo, man ni udul ceke m’i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewo dho mungu m’araga woko kud i ot pa Yehova, ecidho kude ng’ei Yerusalem, ba kulo Kidron, man ewang’e dhu kulo Kidron, e eode edoko ni utur, man eoyo uturne wi liend dhanu ma sai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man erwombo udi mi jusodomi piny, ma gini i ot pa Yehova, ka ma mon gicwio ie bongu m’ang’aba pi mungu m’araga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewodho julam ceke woko kud i adhura mi Yuda, man ecido ka ma malu ma naka julam wang’u ie udok ma ng’wice ng’ar, ugambre Geba cil kum Ber-ceba; man emoro gang’ mi ka ma malu piny ma gini i kamondo mi dhugang’ pa Yocuwa ma jabim mir adhura, ma gini yo ku cing’ dhanu ma yor acwic ma ni dhugang’ mir adhura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento julam mi ka ma malu giidho malu ngo ba pemblam pa Yehova i Yerusalem, ento gicamu kwen ma thobi mbe i ie i kind utumeggi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
