              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ecido Tofeth, ma ni i poga mi nyithindho pa Hinom, kara ng’atu moko kud uketh wode kadi nyare ukadh kud i mac ba Molek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ekabu riuni m’ubimo mi Yuda mio ni ceng’ woko, i kamondo mi ot pa Yehova, i ng’et kusika pa Nathanmelek ma jagwokpiny, ma ni i lela; man ewang’u magali mi ceng’ ku mac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ub 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kei 33:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man pemblam ma ni wi ot mi kusika ma malu pa Ahaz, m’ubimo mi Yuda timo, man pemblam ma Manase timo i lelagang’ ario mi ot pa Yehova, ubimo mugo piny, man eodogi piny ku keca, man eoyo uturne i kulo Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo cido ka ma malu ma ni i wang’ Yerusalem, ma ni yo ku cing’ ma yor acwic ni got mi nyoth, ma Suleman m’ubimo mir Israel ugomo ni Actoreth ma en e ginmajudagu mi Jusidoni, man ni Kemoc ma en e ginmajudagu mi Moab, man ni Milkom ma en e ginmajudagu mi nyithindho mir Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man eturo mbegi nziki nziki, man etong’o mungu m’araga piny, man epong’o kakagi ku cogo mi dhanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
