              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 12:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ke eturo pemblam piny ma ni Beth-el, man ka ma malu ma Yeroboam ma wod Nebat, m’uketho Israel udubo, utimo, en e pemblam maeno ku ka ma malu de; e ewang’u ka ma malu man eode edoko ni utur, man ewang’u mungu m’araga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka Yosia lokre gire, eneno udiliel ma ni keca i got; man eoro kwenda, e ewodho cogo woko kud i udiliende, man ewang’ugi wi pemblamne, e ecide, calku lembe pa Yehova ma dhanu pa Mungu yero, m’eyero pi gin maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.30+1KI.13.31+1KI.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ub 13:30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elund ewacu kumae, Jampoi maeni en e ang’o m’aneno? Man dhanu mir adhurane giyero ire kumae, En e odliel pa dhanu pa Mungu, m’uai i Yuda, man m’uyero pi gin maeni m’itimo kum pemblam mi Beth-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ewacu kumae, Wek edong’; ng’atu moko kud ukab cogone. Kum kumeno giweko cogone dong’, karacelo ku cogo pa jabila m’uai i Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yosia kabu udi ceke woko bende mi ka ma malu ma ni i adhura mi Samaria, m’ubimo mir Israel utimo kara unyai ng’ecwiny i Yehova, man etimo i kumgi calku tic ceke m’etimo i Beth-el. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man enego julam ceke mi ka ma malu ma ni kuca, wi pemblam, man ewang’u cogo dhanu i wigi; e edok Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
