        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoiakim rundi pare pier ario wi abic kinde m’emaku camu ker; man ecamu ker rundi apar wi acel i Yerusalem: man nying’ min mire Zebida ma nyar Pedaya ma Ruma. ",
          "type": "text",
